==Overview==
'''Buzzsaw Mutant Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] added on the [[Episode 62 Update]]. It appears on [[Nightmare Mode]] and is ver strong, as it can also stun your units with its buzzsaw for a few seconds.
== Waves==
=== Nightmare Mode ===
*Wave 28 X1.
=== Abysmal Mode (Halloween Event) ===
*TBA
=== Abysmal Mode (Thanksgiving Event) ===
*TBA
=== Christmas Mode ===
*TBA

=== Endless Mode ===

* Wave 32 X2

== Strategy ==

* High DPS [[units]] can easily defeat it.
* You can stun them for 3-5 seconds using [[Upgraded Titan Cinemaman]] to defeat them easily.
* You can use some Slowing Units to completely slow him down, and because he's already slow he will be easily defeated.

